{"name":"Aviva","hex":"#c5b47f","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Aviva","blocks":[{"text":"Aviva plc is a British multinational insurance company headquartered in London, England. It has about 25.2 million customers in the United Kingdom, Ireland and Canada. In the United Kingdom, Aviva is the largest general insurer and a leading life and pensions provider. Aviva is also the second-largest general insurer in Canada."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Aviva_Logo.svg/330px-Aviva_Logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aviva","wikidata":"Q791179"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Gas_Lamp_no._313_London_and_Lancashire_Fire_and_Life_in_Dublin.jpg/500px-Gas_Lamp_no._313_London_and_Lancashire_Fire_and_Life_in_Dublin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Gas_Lamp_no._313_London_and_Lancashire_Fire_and_Life_in_Dublin.jpg/1280px-Gas_Lamp_no._313_London_and_Lancashire_Fire_and_Life_in_Dublin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Gas_Lamp_no._313_London_and_Lancashire_Fire_and_Life_in_Dublin.jpg/500px-Gas_Lamp_no._313_London_and_Lancashire_Fire_and_Life_in_Dublin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Predecessor company London and Lancashire Fire and Life, pictured in Dublin, c. 1871","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGas_Lamp_no._313_London_and_Lancashire_Fire_and_Life_in_Dublin.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/AvivaCanadaMarkhamHeadquarters4.jpg/500px-AvivaCanadaMarkhamHeadquarters4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wi